-- version 1.6

---------- SUMMARY -----------

-- 4 new national heroes for Wood Elves, Vampires, Cathay. 4 new chaos-god-specific sacred troops for Beastmen. Some new troops for Cathay, Dark Elves, Blood Dragon Vampires, and one commander summon for Cathay. The usual small set of balance tweaks and fixes.
