---------- SUMMARY -----------

-- This new version adds a completely new nation, the Hobgoblin Khanate. The Khanate are what I would call a 'minor faction' and so involve less work on my part than the other factions, have less new content, and are pitched at a lower power level. I may make more minor factions in the future, I'm not sure.
