#armor 12 -- scale mail hauberk
#armor 20 -- iron cap
#weapon 1155 -- spiritbane glaive
#forestshape 14156
#rpcost 18
#att 13
#hp 10 -- tougher
#str 10 -- stronger
#mor 15
#mr 13 -- specialists in fighting magical crap
#spiritsight
#end


