---------------- CULT OF PLEASURE DETAILED EXPLAINER (turn 0 version) -----------------

#newevent
#msg "Cult of Pleasure detailed explainer:

There are 3 tiers of cult (C1-3) and one extreme site (C4). They require a Dark Elf Fort. C1-3 are automatically removed in enemy controlled provinces. Only one upgrade/downgrade per month. Local Dominion of 7+ guarantees no chance of upgrade or C4 appearing. C3 and C4 cannot appear in Dark Elf capital. Monthly events for each site are listed below:

No site: 25% chance C1 added. Male and female cultist separately give 15% C1 added.

(C1) Decadent Gatherings: 25% upgrade to C2. Male and female cultist separately give 15% upgrade to C2.
Candles*10% removal.

(C2) Cult of Pleasure: 3% Slaaneshi Sorceress with 2d3 Advocates. 25% upgrade to C3. Male and female cultist separately give 10% upgrade to C3.
Candles*7% downgrade to C1.

(C3) Shrine of Pleasure: 3% Anointed with 5d3 Marauders, 3d6 Bleakswords. 3% 3d3 Hellstriders. 40% herald assassination of Temple builder. 50% destroy local Temple. 15% C4 added + troops/popkill/unrest.
Candles*7% downgrade to C2.

(C4) Gate of Slaanesh: 50% 1 Seeker. 50% 1 Fiend. 100% 1d3 Daemonettes. 5% Herald with 2d3 Daemonettes, 1d3 Fiends, 1d3 Seekers. 50% herald assassination of Temple builder. 50% destroy local Temple.
Candles*5% removal."
#nolog
#req_owncapital 1
#req_fornation 178 -- Dark Elves
#req_pregame 1 -- only happens before the first turn of the game
#nation 178 -- Dark Elves
#rarity 5
#header 2
#end


