#descr "Vardek Crom, known as Crom the Conqueror, Herald of Archaon, was once an undefeated Chaos Lord pledged to the service of Chaos Undivided that lead a mighty warhost across the Chaos Wastes in search of a foe that might provide a true challenge. For near a hundred years Crom butchered Champion after mighty Champion of the individual Chaos Gods, ending their journey to Daemonhood and taking command of any amongst their followers that he deemed strong enough. In time Crom became a legendary warrior the match of any in history, yet he never sought the gift of Daemonhood, for deep in his soul he knew he had a different fate: to meet a warrior that would prove his match. Crom's desire was eventually realised, for Archaon the Everchosen, thirteenth of his kind sought out Crom's warhost to add to his massive army. Crom strode forth to meet Archaon in single combat that day, but on coming face to face with the Slayer of Kings he was overcome with absolute faith that this man was more than his match, fell to one knee and swore undying loyalty to Archaon. Since then Crom has acted as Archaon's second in command and Herald of the Everchosen. Crom is an iron disciplinarian, inspirational leader, and sharp tactician, but his true power lies in his near peerless skill in single combat. So versed in the use of all weapons is the Conqueror that he is able to wield a runed sword, axe, and shield simultaneously and with great skill. Furthermore he is blessed by all four Chaos Gods and spreads the dominion of Chaos Undivided wherever he treads and his mere presence attracts similarly minded Warriors of Chaos Undivided.

