#descr "There are those amognst the ranks of the Chaos Warriors who bear the clear favour of Nurgle and have been elevated as the Chosen of the Plague God and granted even greater physical prowess and skill. The Chosen are hulking brutes, terrible to behold, their filth encrusted armour often ruptured and distorted by the festering, bloated flesh of the Chosen, for Nurgle spares the caress of no disease or parasite when it comes to the greatest of his mortal servants. The Chosen of Nurgle may lack the unnatural grace and skill of the elite of Slaanesh, or the boundless rage of Khorne, but they are the anointed of the oldest Chaos God and they are a foe as implacable and inevitable as the grave itself. Even the most grievous blows that cleave through their thick armour and layers of supperating flesh will often fail to stop them, for the Chosen are vessels of teeming, seething life that stretches the limits of the mortal form. The Chosen have reached the end of their path, never destined to rise toward the ultimate goal of Daemonhood, but their souls please Nurgle greatly and will surely know his embrace even in death. The Chosen are sacred to the followers of the Urfather.

