#name "Forsaken Warrior"
#descr "The Ruinous Powers are as fickle as they are implacable and though Nurgle is the most indulgent of his kind he is as likely as his siblings to twist the form of a failing follower into one more to his liking. Rather than meting out this fate as a punishment, Nurgle instead views it as a new chance for the mortal to thrive and become more than they were, but the result is the same; rather than the proud Chaos Warrior joining the ranks of the Chosen they instead become Forsaken or are turned into a Chaos Spawn. The Forsaken are those unfortunates who Nurgle has seen fit to rework into berserk mutants eager to find death in battle, for unlike Chaos Spawn they are entirely aware of their own fallen condition. Forsaken are not the disciplined and well armoured heavy infantry or cavalry they once were, instead they are whirling, malformed shock troops typically thrown to the frontlines to inflict as much damage as possible before they are cut down. To the Chaos Warriors they are a reminder of the risks of their path, but to the massed Marauders they are considered equals of the Warriors who simply bear the blessings of the Urfather in a different fashion. Nurgle is an enthusiastic supporter of life in all forms and his Forsaken are particularly blessed with physical gifts."
