---------------- WELCOME TO NURGLE -----------------

#newevent
#msg "Nurgle special mechanics explainer:

Path of the Warrior. Your Chaos Warriors and Knights can through XP earn the chance to be promoted to a Chosen or Blightkin. They won't change form until the turn after the game announces their promotion and it can only happen when they are outside of their home province. They then face the judgement of Nurgle and become Chosen, Blightkin, Forsaken, or a Chaos Spawn.

Path of the Champion. Your military commanders can also earn promotion for a chance of a more powerful form. Unlike the troops it can trigger in their home province. Aspiring Champions become Exalted Heroes who become Chaos Lords who finally become a Daemon Prince. At each stage of judgement Nurgle may turn them into a Chaos Spawn (the Spawn is a troop), though the Spawn will usually be one of the more powerful kinds.

Plagues. A unique plague may emerge in a forted province other than your cap with 10k+ population, 5+ dominion, temple and lab. The plague will spread over time, harming the enemy and helping you. Plague Doctors can help this spread. There are two unique plagues currently, each of which will be outlined in its own message. A third plague may be unlocked by a certain hero.

Additionally your dominion increases death scales in provinces you don't control."
#header 2 -- use the first line of the event as the header
#nolog
#req_owncapital 1
#req_pregame 1 -- only happens before the first turn of the game
#req_fornation 173
#nation 173
#rarity 5
#end


