#name "Curseling"
#descr "Vilitch the Curseling, also known as the Twisted Twin, is a Sorcerer of considerable power that has headed several large incursions of Chaos Hosts under the banner of Tzeentch. Born the far lesser and weaker of two twin boys Vilitch was mercilessly bullied by his hulking, muscular brother Thomin and mocked by his tribe for his frailty; Thomin grew to be a renowned fighter and pursued the Path of the Warrior, while Vilitch was cursed to be a barely competent apprentice to the tribe's Shaman. This all changed one night when his tribe received Thomin in a great feast to honour his recent conquests and, as the festivities carried on, Vilitch prayed to Tzeentch, a prayer for a reversal of fortune which the Architect of Fate, on a whim, granted. In a crackling whirl of energy Vilitch and his twin brother were physically fused and their minds merged, with Vilitch forever taking control of his mighty sibling's actions. Though Thomin an arm and his mind he was filled with even greater unholy strength than before, while Vilitch, previously only able to muster a few cantrips, was transformed into an innately powerful Sorcerer. In battle the transfigured form of Thomin and Vilitch is a truly terrible foe capable of unleashing great magical power while slicing through the enemy ranks with a huge runed greatsword held one handed."
