---------------- WELCOME TO Tzeentch -----------------

#newevent
#msg "Tzeentch special mechanics explainer:

Path of the Warrior. Your Chaos Warriors and Knights can through XP earn the chance to be promoted to a Chosen. They won't change form until the turn after the game announces their promotion and it can only happen when they are outside of their home province. They then face the judgement of Tzeentch and become Chosen, Forsaken, or a Chaos Spawn.

Path of the Champion. Your military commanders can also earn promotion for a chance of a more powerful form. Unlike the troops it can trigger in their home province. Aspiring Champions become Exalted Heroes who become Chaos Lords who finally become a Daemon Prince. At each stage of judgement Tzeentch may turn them into a Chaos Spawn (the Spawn is a troop), though the Spawn will usually be one of the more powerful kinds.

Gates and Secrets. As you accumulate Secrets you will unlock Gates, sites in your capital that will grant you a reward when first unlocked and a reward each turn. Each turn you are told how many more Secrets are required to unlock the current gate. You get 1 secret per turn for each enemy province, enemy temple, and enemy lab in your Dominion. You get 10 if you fully control a lab outside your Dominion, though the lab is destroyed in return. There are 9 gates, though you cannot unlock the 9th."
#header 2 -- use the first line of the event as the header
#nolog
#req_owncapital 1
#req_pregame 1 -- only happens before the first turn of the game
#req_fornation 174
#nation 174
#rarity 5
#end


