#newevent
#msg "Khanate special mechanics explainer:

The Hobgoblin Khanate is a minor faction in the Warhammer fantasy lore and as such is intended to be weaker than other nations in the mod. I hope they are good fun for those seeking a challenge!

Two of your military leaders (Goblin Boss, Hobgoblin Khan) will be 'promoted' when they reach a certain amount of experience points. This will add the term 'Rising' to their name, e.g. 'Goblinn Boss Rising', but they will otherwise be unchanged. Any 'Rising' commander has a chance each turn to trigger an event which will transform them to the next tier of military commander and grant them some free troops. This transformation will also remove most of their gained experience. Only one of these promotion events can happen in each province in each turn.

The progressions are as follows:

Goblin Boss -> Goblin Big Boss
Hobgoblin Khan -> Hobgoblin Thunderkhan

From the tenth turn onwards there is a 30% chance each turn for the Hobgobla Khan to arrive. Thereafter if there is no Hobgobla Khan all your provinces will suffer unrest until a new Hobgobla Khan emerges, which requires a Thunderkhan to be in your capital and has a 50% chance per turn."
#header 2 -- use the first line of the event as the header
#nolog
#req_owncapital 1
#req_pregame 1 -- only happens before the first turn of the game
#req_fornation 177
#nation 177
#rarity 5
#end


