#newmonster 15593
#copystats 15350 -- template human
#spr1 "Sombre_Warhammer/Warhammer_Araby/Araby_Carpet.tga"
#spr2 "Sombre_Warhammer/Warhammer_Araby/Araby_Carpet2.tga"
#name "Carpet Rider"
#descr "Araby has a long tradition of using magic items in place of relying on the fickle and often weak winds of magic. One area where Arabyan mages have made particularly impressive progress is the enchantment of objects to be lighter or even to fly through the air; a technique originally used to assist the vital trade caravans that are the source of Araby's wealth. The main military application of this school of enchantment is in flying carpets capable of carrying a soldier into battle. Carpet Riders have minor magical talent sufficient to maintain the enchantments woven into the fabric of the carpet and have extensive training required to gain every advantage from their mobility. They are infamous amongst their enemies for their agility and defensive abilities and greatly feared for their propensity to strike at weak points in the enemy line. They must keep one hand free to steer their 'steed' but in the other wield a flashing enchanted scimitar.

