#msg "Monthly Araby special mechanics explainer:

The City States of Araby are a minor faction in the Warhammer fantasy lore and as such are intended to be weaker than other nations in the mod. I hope they are good fun for those seeking a challenge!

Your Fire and Air Lampbearer mages will automatically summon a Djinn with F2G1 or A2G1 respectively to assist them in battle. The Djinn cannot be controlled and are prone to casting relatively unhelpful spells.

Your Sultans provide you with the ability to recruit your sacred Dervishes and your elite Sultanate Guard. Their presence in the same province is also required to keep your Sultanate Guard and each type of Sultanate Guard or New Guard not in the presence of a Sultan will suffer 2d6 losses per turn.

Your Sultans can gift you with magical items. Each turn each forted province containing a Sultan has a 7% chance to gift you a random magical item of rarity 1-7."
#header 2 -- use the first line of the event as the header
#nolog
#req_owncapital 1
#req_fornation 180
#nation 180
#rarity 5
#end



